          "title": "Ingress and Ingress Controllers",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Ingress and Controller",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Ingress== = HTTP/HTTPS rules by host and path → Services",
                "Gives **L7** routing, TLS termination, one entry point",
                "Alone it does nothing: a ==controller== (NGINX, Traefik, HAProxy, cloud ALB) configures the proxy",
                "Controller itself is exposed via LoadBalancer or NodePort"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Client",
                    "ink": "black"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "LB",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Controller",
                    "sub": "proxy",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Service",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pod",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. LoadBalancer vs Ingress",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "LB Service",
                "Ingress"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Layer",
                  "L4",
                  "L7"
                ],
                [
                  "Per LB",
                  "one Service",
                  "many Services"
                ],
                [
                  "Host/path",
                  "none",
                  "yes"
                ],
                [
                  "Successor",
                  "—",
                  "Gateway API"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Example and Pitfalls",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`host` + `path` + ==Prefix== route to Service `api`; `tls` secret enables HTTPS"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "yaml",
              "lines": [
                "spec:",
                "  ingressClassName: nginx",
                "  tls: [{secretName: app-tls}]",
                "  rules:",
                "  - host: app.example.com",
                "    http: {paths: [{path: /api, pathType: Prefix,",
                "      backend: {service: {name: api,",
                "        port: {number: 80}}}}]}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "No controller, or wrong/missing `ingressClassName` → **silently ignored**",
                "Backend name or port typo → 503 or 404"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**Ingress vs controller?** Rules object vs the proxy enforcing it",
                "**Why not an LB per Service?** One LB, many Services, L7 routing",
                "**TLS?** `tls.secretName` points to a certificate Secret"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
